-= ANetDRAW v0.2.0 (C/OpenDoors) =-
ANSI + ASCII art studio: TheDraw, ACiDDraw,
Moebius and PabloDraw in one. Mouse, 3700+
TDF fonts, blocks, image import, ZMODEM,
gallery, live shared wall. A BBS door AND a
stand-alone ANSI editor for your own PC.
Linux, Pi and Windows builds.
